      "title": "macOS: Make sure we rpathify QtNetwork.",
      "message": "macOS: Make sure we rpathify QtNetwork.\n\nQtNetwork might be linked with brotli, so make sure we fix up its rpath.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 308d9d1856e3b279354a0cc14d2872533584007d)\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
