      ],
      "title": "macOS: Try to make sure we can find brotli.",
      "message": "macOS: Try to make sure we can find brotli.\n\nlibbrotlidec and libbrotlicommon show up in `otool -L` without any path\ninformation on the macOS builders, similar to what's described at\n\nhttps://github.com/google/brotli/issues/934\n\nTry to work around this in osx-app.sh.\n\n(cherry picked from commit bf6f2068ab880fc3a0b7eab0476a52e8e68d7c65)\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2022-08-18T11:11:14.000-07:00",
